{"id":"n56768-1-7","stage":2,"title":"반달 · 半月","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56768-1-7-1","ko":"어젯밤은 반달이 보이더라.","zh":"昨晚看到半月了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어젯밤은","meaning":"昨夜","explanation":"어젯밤：昨夜；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"어젯밤","audio":"/audio/faa5384e3766467459a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67078","senseId":"1","lemma":"어젯밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어젯밤은","audio":"/audio/1ba11f8d5bd0d35e534f.mp3"}},{"text":"반달이","meaning":"半月","explanation":"반달：半月；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"반달","audio":"/audio/c314951b8e3dd73c5536.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56768","senseId":"1","lemma":"반달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반달이","audio":"/audio/beabf7d6967c2144eaff.mp3"}},{"text":"보이더라.","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이더라","audio":"/audio/90577e8924c70d1f2c54.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"faa5384e37664674","term":"어젯밤","zh":"昨夜","audio":"/audio/faa5384e3766467459a5.mp3","entryId":"67078","definition":"昨天的夜晚。","pronunciation":["어제빰","어젣빰"]},{"id":"c314951b8e3dd73c","term":"반달","zh":"半月","audio":"/audio/c314951b8e3dd73c5536.mp3","entryId":"56768","definition":"半圆形样子的月亮。","pronunciation":["반ː달"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"可见，看得到","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"某种结果出来。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5d6df648dd11605da22b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56768-1-7-2","ko":"응. 음력 팔 일이어서 달이 반 정도밖에 안 보였어.","zh":"嗯，农历初八，月亮大概只看得到一半。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2